A little further on, I see a small stall with yarn.
I decide to learn to knit.
There are many beautiful colours.
I choose two balls of yarn, a blue one and a green one.
"How much does the yarn cost?" I ask the woman in the stall.
"It costs fifty-five kroner per ball," she answers.
I also need knitting needles.
I find two different sizes.
"And what do the knitting needles cost?" I ask.
"They cost thirty-eight kroner for a set," she says.
I pay for my new things.
I look forward to sitting inside and knitting tonight.
